---
// Operating Cash Flow (CFO) vs Net Profit bar comparison exposing paper-profit traps.
const W = 900;
const H = 260;

const ROWS = [
  { y: 66, labelEn: 'Firm A — Net Profit (KQKD)', labelVi: 'Công ty A — Lãi ròng (KQKD)', val: '+200B', w: 200, neg: false },
  { y: 110, labelEn: 'Firm A — Operating Cash Flow (CFO)', labelVi: 'Công ty A — Dòng tiền HĐKD (CFO)', val: '+240B', w: 240, neg: false },
  { y: 164, labelEn: 'Firm B — Net Profit (KQKD)', labelVi: 'Công ty B — Lãi ròng (KQKD)', val: '+200B', w: 200, neg: false },
  { y: 208, labelEn: 'Firm B — Operating Cash Flow (CFO)', labelVi: 'Công ty B — Dòng tiền HĐKD (CFO)', val: '−180B', w: 180, neg: true },
] as const;
---
<figure class="sbp6-cfo">
  <div class="sbp6-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Firm A makes +200B Net Profit backed by +240B Operating Cash Flow. Firm B reports +200B Net Profit while Operating Cash Flow bleeds −180B because customers did not pay.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="sbp6-title">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Minute 4 Lie Detector: Net Profit vs Operating Cash Flow (CFO) over the year</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Phút 4 Máy phát hiện nói dối: Lãi ròng (LNST) so với Dòng tiền kinh doanh (CFO)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Zero axis */}
      <line x1="560" y1="54" x2="560" y2="246" class="sbp6-axis" />
      <text x="560" y="48" text-anchor="middle" class="sbp6-axis-lbl">0</text>

      {ROWS.map((r) => (
        <g>
          <text x="20" y={r.y + 19} class={r.neg ? 'sbp6-lbl sbp6-red' : 'sbp6-lbl'}>
            <tspan data-lang-en>{r.labelEn}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{r.labelVi}</tspan>
          </text>
          <rect
            x={r.neg ? 560 - r.w : 560}
            y={r.y}
            width={r.w}
            height="28"
            rx="5"
            class={r.neg ? 'sbp6-bar-red' : 'sbp6-bar-green'}
          />
          <text
            x={r.neg ? 560 - r.w - 10 : 560 + r.w + 10}
            y={r.y + 19}
            text-anchor={r.neg ? 'end' : 'start'}
            class={r.neg ? 'sbp6-val sbp6-red' : 'sbp6-val'}
          >
            {r.val}
          </text>
        </g>
      ))}
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Profit is an accounting opinion; Operating Cash Flow (CFO) is bank cash collected. Whenever multi-quarter cumulative Net Profit climbs while cumulative CFO runs negative, cash is getting trapped in unpaid receivables or unsold stock.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Lợi nhuận trên KQKD là phép ghi nhận kế toán; Dòng tiền HĐKD (CFO) là tiền tươi thu về thật. Nếu nhiều quý liền lãi ròng dương cao mà CFO âm sâu, lợi nhuận đó đang kẹt chết trong khoản phải thu hoặc tồn kho ế.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp6-cfo { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp6-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp6-cfo svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp6-cfo text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp6-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp6-axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .sbp6-axis-lbl { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp6-lbl { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp6-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp6-bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp6-bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp6-val { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp6-cfo figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
